{"id":"a14c33ea0c47a173","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-soundness-theory.md","title":"Soundness (Theory)","display":"df-soundness-theory — Soundness (Theory)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-soundness-theory","aliases":["90-df-soundness-theory"],"display":"df-soundness-theory — Soundness (Theory)","depends_on":["[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-structure]]","[[90-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-soundness-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-soundness-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-soundness-theory — Soundness (Theory)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"264cfff82242245c\" href=\"?note=264cfff82242245c\" title=\"90-df-structure\">90-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d4aaea13d19cf090\" href=\"?note=d4aaea13d19cf090\" title=\"90-df-satisfaction\">90-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\sigma\">\\(T\\vdash\\sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"264cfff82242245c\" href=\"?note=264cfff82242245c\" title=\"90-df-structure\">90-df-structure</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^\\sharp\">\\(S^\\sharp\\)</span>-结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d4aaea13d19cf090\" href=\"?note=d4aaea13d19cf090\" title=\"90-df-satisfaction\">90-df-satisfaction</a>，签名翻译见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (formal signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-structure)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal M}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal M}\\)</span> (soundness predicate relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span>, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}theory}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal M}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\sigma\\rightarrow\\mathcal M\\models\\sigma\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}theory}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal M}(T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(T\\vdash\\sigma\\rightarrow\\mathcal M\\models\\sigma\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal M}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\mathcal M}(T)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 相对于结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 可靠</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>只证明真句子</li>\n<li>当算术符号在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 中按标准自然数解释时，任何可证存在句有标准见证；这说明标准模型可靠性排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致。此说明不把任意非标准结构的可靠性当作标准模型可靠性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syn